  "description": "The meme leverages the racial slur 'nagger' to perpetuate a harmful anti-Black stereotype. This stereotype reduces Black individuals to a demeaning caricature, implying inferiority or undesirability. The use of such a slur in a meme context is not merely offensive; it is a form of racial hate speech that reinforces systemic racism and prejudice against Black people.",
